@host = http://localhost:5081

### Exercise 1: HTTP 200, JSON
GET {{host}}/hello

### Exercise 2: HTTP 200, status / timestampUtc / version
GET {{host}}/health

### Exercise 3: HTTP 200, public settings only
GET {{host}}/api/v1/config

### Exercise 4: versioned route group
GET {{host}}/api/v1/hello

### Exercise 5a: list (HTTP 200)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/notes

### Exercise 5b: create (HTTP 201 + Location)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Shopping list",
  "content": "Bread and milk"
}

### Exercise 5c: validation (HTTP 400)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   ",
  "content": "bad example"
}

### Replace GUID with ID returned by POST (HTTP 200)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/notes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Replace GUID with ID returned by POST (HTTP 204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/notes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
